        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Emtek 1625, 2 x 10 Arched Style Multi Point Trim with American Cylinder Below Handle</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nMultipoint Trim sets like the 2 x 10 Sandcast Bronze Arched American Cylinder Multi-Point Trim are typically used on patio doors that already have the multipoint lock mechanisms installed. This one features an American Cylinder Hub below the handle with a 3-5/8 inch center to center. The Arched Style Multi Point Trim with American Cylinder Below Handle is made out of sandcast bronze and is available in flat black bronze, medium bronze, and white bronze finishes. The rustic appearance that is achieved from the sandcasting process makes this Multi-Point Handleset a great choice for farmhouses and cottages.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis multipoint trim set is intended to replace the trim from Milgard and Pella brand patio doors. The lock to lever distance is 3-5/8\" (92 mm). <b>This set does not come packaged with the multipoint lock mechanism</b> (the vertical rods found in multipoint patio doors that secure the door to the frame) as those are typically preinstalled in multipoint doors and cannot be replaced.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nSandcasting is a process for casting metal in sand molds. The mold is made by packing the sand around a pattern. Molten bronze is then poured into a mold cavity formed out of sand. Each sand mold is used only once. The sand is then recycled for the next piece.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-Door-configuration-6-specifcations.gif?v=1704354606\" width=\"186\" height=\"229\" border=\"0\" align=\"right\" alt=\"Emtek Configuation #6 Diagram\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features and Specifications</b> of the Arched Style Multi Point Trim with Door Configuration #6:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Sandcast Bronze</li>\r\n<li>Overall Height: 10\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Width: 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Distance Between Trim and Cylinder or Thumbturn (for Keyed, Passage, and Patio Functions): 3-5/8\"</li> \r\n<li>Mounting Centers: 8-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Thickness: 3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-5/8\" - 2-3/4\" please specify.</li>\r\n<li>Solid steel spindle.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-2x10-config-6-specificaion.pdf?v=1704262361\" target=\"new\"><b>Emtek 1621 Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available Functions:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Dummy Pair, Active (inside):</b> Active lever inside with fixed inactive lever outside. For use as a pull or to match trim. Normally used on inactive French door. Set includes: Two (2) backplates, Two (2) levers with spindles and mounting screws.</li>\r\n<li><b>Dummy Pair, Inactive:</b> Fixed inactive levers both sides of door. For use as a pull or to match trim. Normally used on inactive French door. Set includes: Two (2) backplates, Two (2) levers with spindles and mounting screws.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage:</b> Active levers both sides of door. Set includes: Two (2) backplates, Two (2) levers with spindles, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n<li><b>Patio:</b> Active levers both sides of door. Thumb turn inside to lock door. Set includes: Two (2) backplates, Two (2) levers with spindles, One (1) interior thumb turn and mounting screws.</li>\r\n<li><b>Keyed Entry:</b> Active levers both sides of door. Keyed lock cylinder outside with thumb turn inside to lock door. Set includes: Two (2) backplates, Two (2) levers with spindles, Two (2) cylinder collars, One (1) american profile cylinder with key outside & thumb turn inside and mounting screws.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nChoose any of the different levers to complete your handleset.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-sandcast-finish.jpg?v=1704354510\" width=\"570\" height=\"191\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Emtek Finish Chart\">\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "2 x 10 Sandcast Bronze Arched American Cylinder Multi-Point Trim",
                "description": "Multipoint Trim sets like the 2 x 10 Sandcast Bronze Arched American Cylinder Multi-Point Trim are typically used on patio doors that already have the multipoint lock mechanisms installed. This one features an American Cylinder Hub below the handle with a 3-5/8 inch center to center. The Arched Style Multi Point Trim with American Cylinder Below Handle is made out of sandcast bronze and is available in flat black bronze, medium bronze, and white bronze finishes. The rustic appearance that is achieved from the sandcasting process makes this Multi-Point Handleset a great choice for farmhouses and cottages.\r\n",
